        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alan Garner, William Buckley\n- Products: Strandloper\n- Topics: novels, English writers, convicts, transportation to Australia, escape, Aboriginal communities\n\nFacts:\n- In 1996, Alan Garner published the novel Strandloper.\n- William Buckley was an English convict who was transported to Australia.\n- William Buckley escaped after being transported to Australia and was given up for dead.\n- William Buckley lived in an Aboriginal community for many years.\n- William Buckley lived from 1780 to 30 January 1856.",
